mentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-02-07T15:36:14Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T15:53:05Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nmacos - v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis similar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/61491\n\nUsing a tween triggers the same errors:\n\n```gdscript\nvar t = create_tween()\nt.tween_property(decal, \"scale\", Vector3.ZERO, 3.0)\n```\n\nThe code console will spam\n\n```\nE 0:00:03:0395   invert: Condition \"det == 0\" is true.\n  <C++ Source>   core/math/basis.cpp:47 @ invert()\n```\n\nI guess this would happen with more cases, not just scale.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a 3d scene, add a Decal node, then use the following script:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node3D\n\n@onready var decal: Decal = $Decal\n@export var target_scale: Vector3 = Vector3.ZERO\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar t = create_tween()\n\tt.tween_property(decal, \"scale\", target_scale, 3.0)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-decal-scale-package.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18708795/bug-decal-scale-package.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102536/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"la